<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">1TH</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TH</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TH</para>
  <para style="mt">1TH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Utasalanikawa u jigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Cikarigo cina ci sirya pa Bulus, Sila na Timoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">koro pa aco na yiwa ne lagana Yesu na Tasalonika una usa u Hwinsu buca na Bugwama bu Dwoniya Yesu kristi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Uno u burya̠ na dala a burya̠ abu laga.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I tano i suwa i Hatasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tohonba ciyiwa ni goji Hwinsu zwama ganhin, na iruba na anhunda naci. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ciyiwa ni goji Hwinsu inga ganhin ni ibwana Hwinsu buca a buci zwama ibwana ina ganhi eagi zwama itano i shuwa, ibwana maka̠la̠ amahin, na i sano ina i ganhi yinsa na koce zwama itanu isuwa nuhin pa Bugwama bu Dwoniya Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ahun namui zwama gaci daki maka̱la̱ ma cuhunwo man masire pa Hwinsu, una ui tanga , <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />zwama cikarigo ci burya̠ ci korya apahin sa na uno uhurpa ula ama na koce a̠huru a burya̠ hinda na idaku.I daki inga ga̠ci cimadale na ga̠hi zwama anpani nuhin. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />I hinana ihugagan cihano ci gaci na cina ci Bugwama bu Dwoniya; ka̱mu na wahala una aba yiwa na pan, ga̱hin i ce cikarigona siwa sirya na wa̱wo una Ahunru a Burya aba ai pan. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Zwama haruni kwa ganhi ni san i mugigo pa aco na lagano Yesu na Makidoniya na Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Zwama pa ganhi cikarigo ci Hwinsu cimaharewa na Makidoniya na Akaya ama itano nihin isuwa tiganba kanmu bwa hogo. zwama haruni ci karuwo ci zwame ihya, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Zwama aco kanmu yiwa ne zwamag inga ganhi ici ce. Aci zwama nga̠ ga̠hi i curi ilagano hwinsu aco kwadwo kwa na ma bicike pa Hwinsu u kamahinda, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />na hinda inga ga̠hi i yiwa a̱pe bwa buba na zaro Yesu Kristi, buna buba a̱singe pa aco akwadwo, buna bu ci handgage na wahala una u yiwa na korwo.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ibwana Bulus na Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ahun nimui, ga̠hi ma i daki, an koro nuci apahin ui sa kamuyo. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />I daki inga ga̠ci ci so wahala dinyiya inga ga̠ci ci kore Filibi, na cidako acihin,ama Hwinsu u ci pan koce una u gaci ci zwamage cikarigo ci laco ci Yesu kristi ka̠mu na iwonjo ina aba yiwa ne ci ciba. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Zwama cikarigo ci burya̠ cina ci gaci ci zwama ci sirya na magwata ko ciri, ko nabe an ci ginbo ne eagya mahansa. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Kwadi, ci yiwa na cikarigo inga aco na Hwinsu uba yaje naba an cutan ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu. Ciza na kokari ci kimgage aco shuwa ama Hwinsu, una u gwaji hasuwa a haci. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Anhun, i daki cikarigo a cici ci za ni eagya uno u burya̠ , ko hinda hasuwa ahaci ha za kodayi u gaci gimbo eagya mahansa-Hwinsu u daki. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ciza na ginbo aco aci yabe, ko ahwahin ko aco mewa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Ama inga sawo si kristi ciza ni curigagya more, zwama ci ginbage taimako, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ko nga̱ ga̱ci ci sa silmajiri si Kristi ama inga amaci aba sa hina ne ia̠gya sawo saba, harbuni gaci ci ia̱gi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Zwama gaci ci ka̱ri dinya ube san gaci kulage cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu ama ka̱mu na a̱huru nuci, hinda zwama isa i maka̠la̠ amaci. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ahun, i daki ni ibwana na pama una ga̱ci ci hoge, ci i ibwana i Hwinsu na gita zwama cita sana more huna una ga̱ci ci kore ne zwamag cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ga̱hin ma i daki, ka̱mu na Hwinsu, zwama ina ga̱ci ia̱gi i burya̠ na gyamace hinda na nagu u ciri amaci pa ga̱hi buna i ce cikarigo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Zwama i daki an ci madale na ga̱hin inga buca buba sibo madale na saawo si buba, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />gaci ci jidani cikarigo ci koce an tigamba bu i madale inga Hwinsu uba oi hoge laco na buba, una oi oga koro pa cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Hinda ga̱ci ci yiwa ne godwo Hwinsu tunba hwinsu zwama, nga̱ ga̱hi i ce cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci kamahinda, cina ci ga̱hi i hoge ahwaci, i cewa sa nga̱ cisa ci buco, ama nga̱ ciba ca kore ahwahin, cikarigo ci Hwinsu, cina ci yiwa ne ibwana na ga̠hi buna ga̠hi ce hinda i yaje. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Zwama ga̱hin, ahun, ina i ia̱gi aco coci u Hwinsu na Yahudiya ube aba yiwa na ia̱gya ga̱hi, harbuni ma ga̱hin i yiwa na hoge wahala pa aco nahin Hayahudawa. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />hayahudawa ha hone Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu na Acuma Hwinsu hinda aci ci cebe nagu u maka̠la̠. Ahacigage Hwinsu suwa kwa ne komgaga aco ka̱mu na suwa <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />a ka̱ri na ci gazga na ia̱gya aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu cikarigo inga aba ai hyan icagago. Na haruni tuhonba aba ne majidagan magwata̱ hal masinji ikwano na jigaga. Ama ubwobwo u suwa Hwinsu u kanzingi pa ba.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus u ginbage u gope ikore pa Hatasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />To, ahun namui, lokaci una aba cirebi na ganhi cimu (ne ikanga sa na suwa), ci i ginbage zwama ci hyan na hisa sici. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ci ginbage ci kolakanya gya Bulus sa korwa uikan ama shatan aci gazga. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Na ihogu ka̱mu, ganhi san i tano suwa nuci, laco nuci, ko aco dinyiya an ai matanagan na yaba i zaro pa Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu hon bware buba bui korya. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Harbuni, ga̱hin isa izagacu nici na wa̱wo nuci.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Zwama haruni,inga gaci hoge zwama u ci sinji suwa, kwa gaci ne hyan u gyamace aci curi gacigaci na Atina. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Kwa gaci ne cuman Timoti, buhun a buci hinda buco boi ibwana i cikarigo ci Hwinsu na icibago i cikarigo ci Kristi, buna bui jidana itano nohin i suwa koce, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />zwama ata hyan buna bui maringya kacuta zwama igwaju. I daki an ina Hwinsu hyen an gaci ci hoge igwaju <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Idaki an, inga gaci yanse na ganhin, ci yanse na zwamgan an ai ci gwadag.Kwa aba nabiya na eagya ga harbuni, inga ganhi ma i daki. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Zwama haruni, inga gya ni hyan ni za i pwana i o'tana, kwa gya ne cuman a byanya yinsa nuboi. Na hoge iwasa an kila shetan a korwa a bu eagu nu burya̠ abu zagacu hinda kokari nuci usa banza.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti a pan labari u laco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ama Timoti a giwo aci zwama an a sire a hwaboi bane hinda aci zwama an busa komgage cikarigo na maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu na burya̠ hinda. Aci zwama inga ganhi iza cikarigo ci burya̠ na ganhi <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Zwama haruniya, ahun namui, sungorwa na wahala nuci ci hoge laco na tano soo nihi ube u cijidane ci pan koce u soo. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />zwama baniya, ci yiwa na hoge laco si yinsa pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Neya gaci pwana i goje Hwinsu zwama soo cine nuci pa Hwinsu zwama ga̠hi. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Gita na hwinsu ci yiwa na ahunda̱ Hwinsu uci ga̱mi na ga̱hi zwama ci pan ina i ga̱hi iza na itano i suwa nuhin <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Baniya Hwinsu na buca na icwa i buba na Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu i pan yina an ga̱ci ci korya a hwa̱hi. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu majine dinyiya na sicwa a sihin na korwa pa aco ka̱mu nga̱ ga̱ci yiwa na ia̱gya. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Hwinsu ui pan koce u suwa hal iza nagu ciri hal u sa aco na aba gingyago a nagu u magwata̠ na kamahinda pa Yesu aba ai korya na aco na yiwa tare na bware.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Dala ana a lacome Hwinsu shuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Na ihogu, ahun, ci cibage inga ga̠hi i ea dala ana ai cinyacuma Hwinsu soo, inga ganhin i yiwa na dala. Baniya ci gami na Hwinsu zwama Bugwama Hwinsu Yesu i zakai dinyiya. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Zwama ga̠hi ma i daki ina ga̠ci ci pan na koce Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Zwama Hwinsu ube u yaje ganhin i ma guzagi: ita yada i eagi cidana; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />hinda kanmu nuhin bu kumgage icwa i buba na yina na aza ciriyo ama mutunci, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />sa tare na kodiyi inga aco na ai sa hayahudawa hab eagu, an ai dakuwo Hwinsu; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />hinda na iruni zwama aco buta ia̠gya buhun buba ko hinda bu ia̠gi bwa laipi. Hwinsu ui pan kanmu buna bu eagi manin magwata, inga gaci ci zwamano hinda ci gargadi. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Zwama Hwinsu ui ci oganya ci e dala a ciri, kwa di dala a nagu u magwata. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Zwama haruni, buna bu wonje cikarigo acici bu wonje Hwinsu, una u ci pan a̠huru a burya̠ .<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Baniya zwama u maka̠la̠ ma buhun ui iwo ci rubuciyo, zwama Hwinsu ma ui cibago an i ka̱ri sicwa an sihinyo. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Hinda kamahinda, i kalo ahun nahin ana ayiwa na Makiddoniya. Ko na haruni, ahun nimui, ima jidane dinya.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Eaje kokari i madale na burya̠ , i iri sicwa an sihin pa ibwana i siwa a sihin, inga gaci ci zwama, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Nga̠ aco na za ne lagana Hwinsu ai hyan dala nahin a burya̠ ai pan cilabe hinda iza madala na anpe kwa ai pa.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uringyewa u Buca̠ bu yaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ahun, ci ka̠runwo i yan na nagu madako zwama aco na labuce, ko aco na kwaji ita eago inga aco na ai tano suwa. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ci yaje ka̠mu nuci an Yesu i kwaji hinda i gope na masinga ci yaje harbuni hinda Hwinsu ringe aco na kwaji aba ne lagana Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />4 Ci yaje ka̠mu nuci an Yesu i kwaji hinda i gope na masinga ci yaje Hwinsu ringe aco na kwaji aba ne lagan Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Na zwamago i cikarigo ci Hwinsu, ci zwama an gaci buna ci sewa ci kwajuwo, ana yiwa na anpe u kurwa u Bugwama bu duniya, ciza izwolaga aco na a kwadagi. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Zwama Bugwama bu dwoniya na icwa i buba bui kanzigya na zaro, na ijumu ikoce na bicwarwa bi acuma a Hwinsu a labe hinda na ihulanu i inigwa i Hwinsu, hinda aco na kwaji aba tare na Yesu kristi abe ai rwaga na masinga. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Hinda, gaci buna cisa kwadaguwo ci masinga ci bangi ga zata na zaro tare naba zwama ci bangi Bugwama bu dwoniya na zaro. Hinda ci yana tare na Yesu dudu. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Zwama haruni hinanaje na manuma hacobe na iri cini cikarigo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Baniya, ahun, zwama hon ni lokaci ui kamacowa ci rubuciyo, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />zwama ga̠hi i daki ka̠mu hon u Hwinsu ui san nga̠ kurwa u buhya ni gita. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Aco na zwamag, &lt;&lt;Dala lafiya dala burya̠,&gt;&gt; ihacigago i kurya na, inga pago o cimaco uba se kuriya bua bu cimaco, hinda iza siriya.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ama ga̠hi, ahun, iza na ci'incu bale ga̠hi in hyan an hon niyo oi pami nga̠ buhya. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ka̠mu nuhin isa sawo si haske hinda sawo si hwinsu. Cisa aco gita ko ci'incu. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Zwama haruni, cita yana inga cagiya aco, ana labuce, ama ci yan na shiri na ikonbo icwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Aco na labuce, sa labuce na geta, aco na sa so maro sa so na geta. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ama gaci cisa sawo hwinsu, ci komgage sicwa a sici, ci komgage itano ishuwa na maka̠la̠ inga garkuwa, na i cagago inga ipwaro iroma. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Zwama Hwinsu ui hinwo ci hoge wahala ama ci ce icagago ina iyiwa pa Yesu Kristi Buca̠ bu yaba <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Kristi i kwaji zwama gaci, ko ciyiwa na malabo ko za na malabo, ci kore ci yan tare na bware. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Zwama haruni mabutaga sicwa a sihin hinda i mataimaki sicwa asihin, nga̠ ga̠hi iyiwa na ia̠ga.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">inumu i hacube ikundat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Baniya ci yiwa na kaban, ahun, i pan aco na yiwa ne ibwana dinya cilabe, aco labe na ibwana i Hwinsu hinda ana yiwa ne eagya cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Kumgag ga na maka̠la̠ dinya zwama ibwana yaba. Madale na burya̠ na tiganba. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Hinda ciyiwa na karfafa, ahun, numoje aco na yiwa na dala a banza, i taimaki aco na za koce, i madale na hankuri na tiganba. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ima sikiyi ita cupa iwo ina aba eagi na iwo, ama ia̠g kokari ia̠gi aco i burya̠ hinda na tiganba.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Eaje wawo tohonba; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />tohonba i ea ahuda̠; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />i goji Hwinsu na tibai, zwama ina Hwinsu uba ginbo na ga̠hin bini ni iziya i Kristi Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ita gazgana cikarigo ca a̠huru aburya̠ ; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />ita yagaga cikarigo ca acubago Hwinsu. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Gwada tibe. Komgaga i burya̠ . <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ita yada na iwo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Hwinsu na icwa yoba, Hwinsu u dala a burya̠ , ui kimgage sihuru asihin. Sihuru asihin ka̱mu, a̱huru na ikanga yan na nagu ciri na hon korwa u Bugwama bu doone Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Hwinsu una u bu o'ga uza magwata ui ia̱ga ina uba hin ui ia̱ga.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ahun, ia̱ ahunda̱ zwa ga̱ci. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Bongage ka̱mu ahun na maka̠la̠ ma burya̠ . <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Na yiwa ne gami na Bugwama bu doone i karanci atakada na hacube ha ahun naci ka̠mu. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />I burya̠ e Bugwama bu doone Yesu Kristi usa nuhin.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>